Among the individual interviewees (@tbl-charcoal_outside_individual), similar to the results on deforestation, most community interviewees suggested there had been a decrease or no change in charcoal production outside the CF. However, NGO representatives and DFOs were significantly more likely to indicate that there had been an increase in charcoal production outside the CF (@tbl-M8_charcoal_outside_individual, @tbl-pairwise_charcoal_outside_individual). Interviewee age was also significant -- older respondents were more likely to state that there had been an increase in charcoal production outside the CF.


